 Forward Traceability

1. It traces a requirement - test case.
2. It checks whether every requirement is covered by testing.
3. Example: Requirement:User should be able to log in with valid username and password- Login Test Case.

 Backward Traceability

1. It traces a test case - requirement.
2. It checks whether each test case is linked to a valid requirement.
3. Example: Login Test Case - User should be able to log in with valid username and password requirement.


